 "summary": "Invoice tax uses ROUND_HALF_EVEN (refund tax differs: ROUND_DOWN)",
 "content": "Invoice tax amounts are rounded with banker's rounding (`decimal.ROUND_HALF_EVEN`), as decided with the finance team in March 2026. Do not use ROUND_HALF_UP. Refund tax is rounded separately with ROUND_DOWN (finance, 2026-10-01)."
